{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Data Breach</strong> is a <strong>1 to 4 player co-op game</strong> about <strong>risk, teamwork, and extraction</strong>. <strong>Steal data</strong>, break into <strong>procedurally generated facilities</strong>, and reach the train before your battery runs dry. <strong>Earn Jolts</strong> to buy <strong>equipment and upgrades</strong>. Encounter <strong>custom built entities</strong>, some hostile and others that can aid or mislead you, shaping every run in unexpected ways. Every mission shifts with <strong>new layouts and threats</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724820/extras/481d121e679b1926c4eb5e2c732a968f.webp?t=1763065727\" width=256 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724820/extras/ecc869c3a47848364d4b8170cf1ccae2.poster.avif?t=1763065727\" width=1170 height=498 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724820/extras/ecc869c3a47848364d4b8170cf1ccae2.webm?t=1763065727\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724820/extras/ecc869c3a47848364d4b8170cf1ccae2.mp4?t=1763065727\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3724820/extras/649ee9ca56058e7aaf3e2014e4eadbb9.webp?t=1763065727\" width=320 height=32 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Jolts you earn to buy gear, upgrades, and storage at the shop. The shopkeeper is always watching, make sure you pay for your items!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_